      UL(['<b>Tape errors</b>: temperature, sag, tension, alignment, incorrect plumbing. Steel tape is standardized at 68 °F, 10–20 lb tension.', '<b>Angles</b>: measure in direct and reverse; average to remove instrument errors.', '<b>Circle formulas</b>: arc length = Rθ (rad); chord = 2R sin(θ/2); sagitta = R(1 − cos(θ/2)).'])
