        text: [
          'Speed: 1 mph = 1.609344 km/h = 1.46667 ft/s = 0.44704 m/s; 1 knot = 1.852 km/h = 1.15078 mph = 0.514444 m/s; 1 ft/min = 0.00508 m/s; Mach 1 at sea level and 15 °C is about 340.294 m/s (it depends on temperature). Flow: 1 US gpm = 0.0630902 L/s = 0.2271 m³/h; 1 cfm = 0.4719 L/s = 1.699 m³/h; 1 L/min = 1/60 L/s; 1 m³/h = 0.277778 L/s; 1 MGD = 43.8126 L/s. Time: 1 day = 86,400 s and 1 week = 604,800 s; calendar units vary: the Gregorian year is about 365.2425 days and the month about 30.4369 days, while the table’s year uses 365.25 days (31,557,600 s).',
          'Angle: 1 rad = 57.29578°; 360° = 2π rad = 400 grad = 6,400 NATO mils; an arcminute is 1/60° and an arcsecond 1/3,600°. Fuel economy: miles per US gallon and litres per 100 km are reciprocal, L/100 km = 235.215 ÷ mpg (US); mpg (imperial) uses 282.481 ÷ mpg(UK); km/L = 100 ÷ (L/100 km).'
        ],
