          'Copy result puts the calculator’s title and every result line on the clipboard as plain text. Save result stores the result and its inputs in the notebook (once all required inputs are complete), where it can restore the inputs later. Inputs are saved as text of up to 200 characters, so the number 3.10 is stored as “3.1”.'
